{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemessosh"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_sosh.png","type":"icon"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Theme Sosh"}],"externalID":"OUDSThemesSosh","modules":[{"name":"Theme Sosh"}],"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Library","title":"Theme Sosh"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["🧬 Theme version: 2.9.0"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the Sosh theme any Sosh product must use, and cannot be subclassed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It embeds also in its target the Sosh brand colors which are not shared nor exposed in lower level targets or outside any module not depending to it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In other words, this "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is based on the abstract "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":", uses all the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" kit and brings the Sosh brand colors and assets."}]},{"style":"tip","name":"Tip","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This theme embeds and registers the fonts for the Sosh theme, you just need to use the theme object as is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Sosh theme does not embed colors for charts yet and is read only: it cannot be subclassed or derivated","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"How to use the theme","anchor":"How-to-use-t